      <abstract>
        <para>
          The &ssg; provides security profiles that &openscap; uses to check a system against a
          security baseline and to remediate rules that fail. For &productname; 16, the &ssg; ships
          the PCI-DSS v4.0.1, HIPAA and ANSSI-BP-028 profiles, plus a draft general system security
          profile. Administrators can scan a system against these profiles and tailor them to local
          requirements without changing the &ssg; content.
        </para>
        <para>
          <emphasis role="bold">Prerequisites</emphasis>
        </para>
        <itemizedlist>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              &productnameshort; 16 in standard mode
            </para>
          </listitem>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              A user account with &sudo; privileges
            </para>
          </listitem>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              A non-production system for testing remediation
            </para>
          </listitem>
        </itemizedlist>
      </abstract>
